# Ending (~21 s) - grand finale in C. The full "Hop Along" motif (hook + answer) as a snappy trumpet fanfare with
# brass stabs and steel-drum answers over an oom-pah tuba, then the hook in augmentation, a bVI - bVII (A-flat,
# B-flat) harp-swept build, and a held C chord with a ritardando (T104 -> T84), snare + timpani roll, final crash.
tempo 120
title Grand Finale
loop 0
echo 8 50 38

# ---------------- C1: trumpet ----------------
C1: @trumpet v12 p0 q6 E1 V0
C1: o4 g8 o5 c8 r8 e8 r8 g8 e8 c8 | o5 a4 g8 e8 ^4 c8 d8 |
C1: o5 f8 a8 r8 o6 c8 r8 o5 a8 g8 f8 | o5 g4 d8 e8 ^4 r8 o4 g8 |
C1: q7 V1 o5 g4 o6 c4 r4 e4 | o6 f4 e4 d4 o5 b4 |
C1: o6 e-4. c8 o5 a-4 o6 c8 e-8 | o6 d4. o5 b-8 f4 o6 d8 f8 |
C1: T104 q8 o6 g1 | T84 ^1 |

# ---------------- C2: brass (stabs, then harmony) ----------------
C2: @brass v9 p-4 q3 E1
C2: o4 r4 {g > c e}8 r8 {g > c e}8 r8 r4 | o4 {a > c e}8 r8 r4 r2 |
C2: o4 r4 {a > c f}8 r8 {a > c f}8 r8 r4 | o4 {b > d g}8 r8 r4 r2 |
C2: q7 o5 c4 e4 r4 g4 | o5 a4 g4 f4 d4 |
C2: o5 c4. o4 a-8 o5 e-4 a-8 o6 c8 | o5 b-4. f8 d4 b-8 o6 d8 |
C2: q8 o5 {e g > c}1 | ^1 |

# ---------------- C3: low strings ----------------
C3: @strings v5 p4 q8 E1
C3: o4 {c e g}1 | o4 {c e a}1 | o4 {c f a}1 | o3 {b > d g}1 |
C3: o4 {c e g}1 | o4 {c f a}2 o3 {b > d g}2 |
C3: o4 {c e- a-}1 | o4 {d f b-}1 |
C3: o4 {e g > c}1 | ^1 |

# ---------------- C4: steel-drum answers, glock, harp sweeps ----------------
C4: @steeldrum v8 p5 q6 E1
C4: r1 | r2 o6 c8 e8 r4 | r1 | r2 o5 b8 o6 d8 r4 |
C4: @glock v6 p6 q8 E1
C4: r2 o6 g8 o7 c8 r4 | r1 |
C4: @harp v8 p5 q8 E1
C4: o4 c16 e-16 a-16 o5 c16 e-16 c16 o4 a-16 e-16 c16 e-16 a-16 o5 c16 e-16 c16 o4 a-16 e-16 |
C4: o4 d16 f16 b-16 o5 d16 f16 d16 o4 b-16 f16 d16 f16 b-16 o5 d16 f16 d16 o4 b-16 f16 |
C4: @glock v6 p6 q8 E1
C4: o6 c16 e16 g16 o7 c16 e16 g16 ^8 r2 | r1 |

# ---------------- C5: tuba oom-pah ----------------
C5: @tuba v11 p0 q5 E0
C5: o2 c4 o1 g4 o2 c4 o1 g4 | o1 a4 o2 e4 o1 a4 g4 | o1 f4 o2 c4 o1 f4 f+4 | o1 g4 o2 d4 o1 g4 b4 |
C5: o2 c4 o1 g4 o2 c4 e4 | o1 f4 a4 g4 g4 |
C5: o1 a-4 o2 e-4 o1 a-4 o2 e-4 | o1 b-4 o2 f4 o1 b-4 b4 |
C5: q8 o2 c1 | ^1 |

# ---------------- C6: kit (bouncy rim, then march, final roll) ----------------
C6: @kit v11
C6: [k4 d4 k8 k8 d4]3 | k4 d4 k8 s16 s16 s8 s8 |
C6: c4 s8. s16 k4 s8. s16 | k4 s8. s16 k8 s8 s16 s16 s16 s16 |
C6: c4 s8 s8 k4 s8 s8 | k8 s8 k8 s8 s16 s16 s16 s16 [s32]8 |
C6: c2 v9 [s32]8 v11 [s32]8 | v13 c1 |

# ---------------- C7: shaker/woodblock, then hats ----------------
C7: @kit v9
C7: [j8 j8 i8 j8]8 |
C7: [h8 h8 n8 h8]8 |
C7: r1 | r1 |

# ---------------- C8: timpani ----------------
C8: @timpani v10 p-2 q8 E1
C8: o3 c4 r4 r2 | o2 a4 r4 r2 | o2 f4 r4 r2 | o2 g4 r4 g8 g8 g8 g8 |
C8: o3 c4 r4 o2 g4 r4 | o2 f4 r4 g4 g8 g8 |
C8: o2 a-4 r4 a-4 a-8 a-8 | o2 b-4 r4 b-8 b-8 b-8 b-8 |
C8: o3 c4 v9 [c32]8 v10 [c32]8 v11 [c32]8 | v12 c1 |
